ui-arrow-keys-move-dial-focus-space-or-enter-selects-the-focused-value-use-ok-to-save-the-dia = Arrow keys move dial focus; Space or Enter selects the focused value. Use OK to save the dialog's time. The standalone illustrations let you explore controls without changing the saved modal value.

