ui-choose-the-clock-format-outside-the-picker-usually-according-to-system-or-app-preferences = Choose the clock format outside the picker, usually according to system or app preferences. A 24-hour picker omits AM and PM: its hour dial uses an outer ring for 1–12 and an inner ring for 13–23 and 00.

