ui-keep-the-dial-s-targets-at-their-intended-size-switch-to-the-input-variant-instead-of-shri = Keep the dial's targets at their intended size. Switch to the input variant instead of shrinking the dial.

ui-adaptive-input = Adaptive input

ui-select-a-field-and-adjust-the-corresponding-dial-or-type-directly-using-keyboard-input-rel = Select a field and adjust the corresponding dial, or type directly using keyboard input. Releasing the clock hand after touch or pointer hour selection advances to minutes. Tap the Hour or Minute field to return to that part of the time; choose AM or PM separately in 12-hour format.

