ui-the-modal-keeps-focus-until-ok-cancel-or-dismissal-outside-the-surface-ok-saves-the-draft = The modal keeps focus until OK, Cancel or dismissal outside the surface. OK saves the draft. Cancel and outside dismissal leave the saved time unchanged; opening the dialog again starts from the saved time.

