ui-keep-the-picker-fully-visible-and-stationary-above-the-page-change-orientation-or-variant = Keep the picker fully visible and stationary above the page. Change orientation or variant rather than making the dial scroll.

ui-name-the-hour-and-minute-fields-separately-and-associate-each-label-with-its-control-assis = Name the hour and minute fields separately and associate each label with its control. Assistive technology can announce the control's role, label and value. A selected state must not depend on color alone. Dial values communicate the time unit, value and position in the set; icon buttons describe the destination input method.

